# Public client-side configuration for the staging deployment target.
# Every value here is public by design (NEXT_PUBLIC_* ships in the browser bundle);
# secrets never belong in this file. The Supabase publishable key is the
# client-safe key type (sb_publishable_*), enforced server-side by FORCE RLS.
